# Keep the build context small: only sources and manifests go into the image build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.claude
.agents
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Compose secrets kept next to the checkout (e.g. a tunnel token) never go into a build context.
secrets
data
apps/server/data
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
coverage
research
openspec
docs
e2e
deploy
*.md
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
